# Laptop only, never uploaded.
# The list that joins participant codes (P1-P6) to the names the thesis recordings are filed under (and any other
# *.local.* file, wherever it is):
configs/*.local.yaml
*.local.*
# The trained model (consent form: never published), any backup or manifest of it, and all other run state (room
# measurement, visitor count, caches):
state/
model_backup_*/
manifest.json
# Raw recordings, home-test reports, logs, the retrain record, the build log, test leftovers:
bench/
reports/bench_*.md
reports/progress.md
logs/
training_*/
.pytest_tmp/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
# Data files and archives, wherever they are (the app is only code, text and pictures):
*.bin
*.npz
*.npy
*.pkl
*.zip
*.tar.gz
